    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκρύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hide under</i> or <i>beneath,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχνῃ ὑπεκρύφθη</span> [the ship]
				<i>was hidden beneath</i> the spray, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.626
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκρύπτεσθαί τινα</span>
			<i>keep</i> something <i>secret from</i> him, v. l.
			in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.9.19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.31.4
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸ ἄνω τὸ κεφάλιον ὑποκεκρύφθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.64
				</span></i>
			.</div>
